// Title: UNC2452 Process Creation Patterns
// Rule ID: 9be34ad0-b6a7-4fbd-91cf-fc7ec1047f5f
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, detection.emerging-threats
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
